# BAVER Technical Specification Sheet

## Unit Specifications
- **Diameter:** 30 cm
- **Weight (total):** 45 kg (30 kg payload + 15 kg structure/dispersal)
- **Coverage Area:** 0.8 - 1.2 hectares (at 20m burst altitude)
- **Gel Thickness:** 1.5 - 3.0 mm (target)
- **Persistence:** 4-12 hours (depending on ambient temperature/humidity)
- **Shelf Life:** 24 months (with preservative)

## Deployment Specifications
- **Aircraft Compatibility:** C-130/L-188 (palletized), UAV pods (custom)
- **Release Altitude:** 300-500m AGL
- **Burst Altitude:** 10-30m AGL (programmable)
- **Cluster Size:** 50 units/pallet (C-130), 6 units/pod (heavy UAV)
- **Effective Sortie:** One C-130 sortie = 4 pallets = 200 units = ~200 hectares treated

## Safety Specifications
- **Minimum Safe Distance:** 500m (personnel), 300m (unmanned assets)
- **Water Setback:** Mandatory 300m from mapped water bodies
- **Biodegradation Timeline:** Shell: 3-6 months; Gel: 1-4 months (soil dependent)
- **Storage:** Class 1.4S explosive (compatible with standard retardant facilities)
